      "message": "That\u0027s ... allowed in C++? TIL\n\nAlso you seemed to have been using a MutexProtected previously but rolled that back. Can you explain why? I feel like I\u0027m missing a lot of context, but that a buffer-scoped mutex should work.",
      "revId": "67d5a0852c60a7c2c02a8a2aaf34b3ce4fd2de4e",
