      "writtenOn": "2025-06-18T20:22:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Talked about this with you offline, but just to document here as well:\n\n- Main issue is that lock per buffer is bad when dealing with submit because we would need to acquire all the locks on every buffer. Acquiring many small locks instead of the current device lock could result in a perf hit, plus the logic becomes a lot more complex.\n- Eventually, I\u0027m thinking of having a `Queue` lock for this stuff instead of the `Device` lock since we only really need to lock these states when we are doing validation and submitting.",
      "parentUuid": "93f05306_1160b1b3",
      "revId": "67d5a0852c60a7c2c02a8a2aaf34b3ce4fd2de4e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
